|               | (4) array reshape           | 7,645        | apply array reshape pragmas                                                            |
|               | (5) access patterns         | 8,006        | array access pattern optmizations                                                      |
|               |                             |              |                                                                                        |
| Performance   |                             |              | After transformations are applied to meet performance pragma targets                   |
